================================================================================
NAVIGATION ARROWS (collapsed handles->fires->navigates)
================================================================================
  FROM             -> TO               CONTROL/MODE         GUARD
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ComposeBar       -> AttachmentSheet  AttachTap/sheet      
  MessageBubble    -> MediaViewer      MediaTap/full        
  ConversationInfo -> Profile          ParticipantTap/push  
  ConversationInfo -> SharedMedia      MediaTap/push        
  ConversationList -> NewConversation  NewMessageTap/sheet  
  ConversationList -> Search           SearchTap/push       
  ConversationList -> Settings         SettingsTap/push     
  ConversationList -> Thread           ComposeTap/push      
  ConversationList -> Thread           RowTap/push          
  NewConversation  -> NewGroup         NewGroupTap/push     
  NewConversation  -> Thread           RecipientTap/push    
  NewGroup         -> Thread           CreateTap/push       
  Search           -> Thread           ResultTap/push       
  SharedMedia      -> MediaViewer      ThumbTap/full        
  Thread           -> ConversationInfo TitleTap/push        

RETURN ARROWS (dismiss = thin return to presenter; returnsTo = boundary outcome-branch):
  ConversationInfo ~> Thread           Back (dismiss)
  MediaViewer      ~> SharedMedia      Back (dismiss)
  NewConversation  ~> ConversationList Cancel (dismiss)
  NewGroup         ~> NewConversation  Back (dismiss)
  Profile          ~> ConversationInfo Back (dismiss)
  Search           ~> ConversationList Back (dismiss)
  Settings         ~> ConversationList Back (dismiss)
  SharedMedia      ~> ConversationInfo Back (dismiss)
  Thread           ~> Search           Back (dismiss)
  AttachmentSheet  ~> Thread           when=cancelled/root (returnsTo)
  AttachmentSheet  ~> Thread           when=failed/root (returnsTo)
  AttachmentSheet  ~> Thread           when=success/root (returnsTo)

================================================================================
PIPELINE TAIL (x-pipeline:feeds)
================================================================================
  [INGEST]
  produces:
    [INGEST] -> ThreadStore            (inboundMessages)

LEGEND:
  [ X ]    component block (renders edge)   : X xN :  repeat:true
  binds:   StateStores the frame reads-through   writes: mutations it owns (! irreversible)
  ->       navigates    ~>  dismiss/return    LOCK[..]  guard assertion
================================================================================
